<!--
  A self-contained clinical world for AllReportsSmokeTest, built so that every report type
  served off the OpenMRS datasource has data to return and can be asserted on by value.

  Every id here is in the 5000+ range. That is deliberate: the eight per-report datasets in
  this directory all reuse the same low id space (patient 1000, obs 1000, ...) for different
  scenarios, so they cannot be loaded together. This one is disjoint from all of them, and
  from the metadata in testDataSet.xml, which it builds on rather than repeats.

  Reuses from testDataSet.xml: concept_class (1 Test, 4 Diagnosis, 7 Question, 8 LabSet,
  10 ConvSet, 16 Program, 17 Workflow, 18 State, 19 Frequency), concept_datatype (1 Numeric,
  2 Coded, 3 Text, 4 N/A, 6 Date), visit_type (1 Initial HIV Clinic Visit, 3 Hospitalization),
  visit_attribute_type (1 Audit Date, 2 Visit Status, 3 Admission Status),
  patient_identifier_type 3 (Bahmni Id), person_attribute_type (1 caste, 5 class),
  order_type (17 Plain Order, 18 DrugOrder), care_setting (1 OUTPATIENT, 2 INPATIENT),
  encounter_type (6 Laboratory, 7 Consultation), location 1, provider 1, encounter_role 1,
  and the "Observation Age Group" rows in reporting_age_group.

  Patient 5000 is an adult (born 1990) with an OPD visit; patient 5001 is a child (born 2015)
  with an inpatient visit, so the two "Observation Age Group" buckets are both exercised.
-->
